en I go  somewhere people come out to the events  right build that up so then when you go  and pitch them you're gonna be so  different then everybody else is  pitching that the companies will fight  over having you on board right when I'm  lining up my book deal I'll have  publishers fight over who gets my book  because of the audience and attraction I  built up and you want the same thing for  you you want to be in a position of  power position of leverage and even  though you need them right I still need  the book publisher to publish this thing  you still need the stores to sell your  stuff or you can create leverage by  having a differentiating factor and  showing some momentum  believe fazil so you're watching like  the video please give it a thumbs up  below it makes gonna do more and I'd  love to hear from you leave a comment  underneath let me know what you're  thinking you have a question of it below  like a video response thank you so much  and I'll see you soon
 

